{"t":"bark","id":"low_hp","shout":"HELP ME!","lines":["Bandaid! ...anyone?","I am fine. Totally fine.","Is that my blood? It is.","Tell my hamster I tried.","I see a light. Is it a cookie?","Running is a strategy, right?"]}
{"t":"bark","id":"hurt","shout":"OW!","lines":["Ow. Not cute.","That is coming out of your snacks!","My good sweater!","Hey! I was walking here!","That one I felt in my soul.","Not the face!","I bruise like a peach!"]}
{"t":"bark","id":"reloading","shout":"HUH?","lines":["Still reloading!","Patience, I am not a vending machine.","Give it a second!"]}
{"t":"bark","id":"passive","shout":"HUH?","lines":["That one works on its own.","Passive. Like me on Mondays.","No button for that, friend."]}
{"t":"bark","id":"no_target","shout":"HUH?","lines":["Nothing to hit!","Save it for a crowd.","Who am I aiming at, the air?"]}
{"t":"bark","id":"empty","shout":"HUH?","lines":["Nothing in that pocket.","Empty slot. Go find loot!","That hand is empty."]}
{"t":"bark","id":"level","shout":"LEVEL UP!","lines":["I feel... SPICY.","Patch notes: me, buffed.","Level up! Mom would be proud.","More power. Less sense.","New level, same bad decisions.","I can feel my build coming together!","Ding! Somebody call the music box."]}
{"t":"bark","id":"streak","shout":"HA HA!","lines":["Combo! Do I get a sticker?","Bits everywhere. Not cleaning that.","Ha! Next!","Is that all you have got?","Five! Count them! Five!","Someone call their manager.","I am the party now."]}
{"t":"bark","id":"special","shout":"BOOM!","lines":["Special delivery!","Ka-POOF.","Say hello to my reload timer!","Behold! ...ok, behold faster."]}
{"t":"bark","id":"frozen","shout":"BRR!","lines":["B-b-brr!","Who left the door open?","C-can't feel my t-toes."]}
{"t":"bark","id":"hungry","shout":"FOOD!","lines":["My stomach is louder than the boss.","Is that a sandwich? Please be a sandwich.","Hero needs food, badly.","I could eat a whole cake."]}
{"t":"bark","id":"gold","shout":"SPARKLY!","lines":["Sparkly!","Cha-ching.","Piggy bank +1.","Mine. All mine.","Coin! My one true love.","The merchant will hear about this."]}
